---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import MedicalDisclaimer from '../components/MedicalDisclaimer.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import authorPhoto from '../assets/denis-ethier.png';
import InteractiveProgressionChart from '../components/InteractiveProgressionChart.astro';
import CardinalNetworkDiagram from '../components/CardinalNetworkDiagram.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead 
			title="My Message for BMS Patients | Decoding The Burn" 
			description="If you're a BMS patient, I understand what you're going through. A direct message on why we must work together—patients, dentists, doctors, and researchers—to solve this fire." 
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="hero-centered-wrapper">
				<div class="hero-centered-header">
					<MedicalDisclaimer />
				</div>

				<!-- Author Photo on Top -->
				<div class="hero-video-centered">
					<div class="video-placeholder-wrapper" style="cursor: default;">
						<Image 
							src={authorPhoto} 
							alt="Denis Ethier - My Message for BMS Patients" 
							class="video-placeholder-img" 
							width={1400} 
							height={788}
						/>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Direct Personal Message -->
				<article class="personal-story-section">
					<h2 class="story-heading">My Message to BMS&nbsp;Patients</h2>
					<div class="story-lead">
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							If you're a BMS patient, I get you. It is a horrendous, agonizing pain. And on top of the constant physical burning, the discovery that dentists and medical doctors don't seem to know much about it is deeply devastating.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							My mission is to continue monitoring my situation, take absolutely nothing for granted, and offer every single one of my self-experiments as open data for the entire community, researchers, dentists, and doctors so we can find real solutions.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							I cannot make promises, and I don't know how many people my discoveries will help. But I know it is worth talking about, documenting, and sharing openly. If all of us share our observations and work together, patients, dentists, doctors, and researchers, we have genuine hope of reducing symptoms, extending pain-free windows, or even eliminating the fire completely.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							In my case, finding my specific dietary and dental triggers has allowed me to remain pain-free for the last 18 months. I don't know if my exact protocol will work for everyone, but my ultimate hope is that by pooling our collective wisdom, we can solve this together.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Interactive 3-Year Progression Timeline Graph -->
					<div class="message-chart-wrapper">
						<InteractiveProgressionChart title="My 3-Year BMS Progression &amp; Triggers" />
					</div>

					<!-- Collaborative Cardinal Network Diagram -->
					<div class="network-diagram-container">
						<h3 class="diagram-section-title">Bridging Patients, Clinicians &amp;&nbsp;Data</h3>
						<p class="diagram-section-subtitle">
							Real breakthroughs happen when patient observations, dental mechanics, medical diagnostics, and laboratory research connect around open&nbsp;data.
						</p>
						<CardinalNetworkDiagram />
					</div>

					<!-- Focused Share Your Story CTA -->
					<div class="collab-cta-box">
						<h3 class="collab-cta-title">Share Your BMS Story</h3>
						<p class="collab-cta-text">
							What worked or didn't work for you? Every pattern, symptom log, and personal observation helps us uncover real answers for the entire community.
						</p>
						<div class="collab-cta-actions">
							<a href="/share-your-story" class="btn btn-primary">Share Your Story</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</article>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.hero-centered-wrapper {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
	}

	.hero-centered-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
	}

	.hero-centered-title {
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.hero-video-centered {
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto 3rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08));
		background: #000000;
	}

	.video-placeholder-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.video-placeholder-img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}

	.personal-story-section {
		background: var(--bg-card, #ffffff);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e2e8f0);
		border-radius: 24px;
		padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
	}

	.story-lead {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto 2rem;
	}

	.story-paragraph {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.message-chart-wrapper {
		margin: 2.5rem 0 3.5rem;
	}

	.network-diagram-container {
		margin: 3.5rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.diagram-section-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		line-height: 1.2;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.diagram-section-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.collab-cta-box {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1136 0%, #0d081a 100%);
		border-radius: 18px;
		padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		text-align: center;
		color: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.collab-cta-title {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #ffffff;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.collab-cta-text {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #e2e8f0;
		max-width: 620px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.collab-cta-actions {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 0.95rem 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: transform 0.15s ease, filter 0.15s ease;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c8382c 0%, #991b1b 100%);
		color: #ffffff;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(200, 56, 44, 0.35);
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		filter: brightness(1.1);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.personal-story-section {
			padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
